Market position

Philip is the top three global suppliers of medical imaging equipment (CT, MRI), and forms an oligarchic pattern with Siemens Healthlines and Ge Health Care. He is also a leader in ultrasound and image-guided therapy. One of the global leaders is Sonicare's electric toothbrush in personal health plates.

